          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the rates for Vessels should be bought in line with industry standards with effect from the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          178.58652521008403,
